# Never stack callouts

Do **not** place two or more guide callouts (NOTE, IMPORTANT, WARNING, TIP HTML divs, or equivalent notice blocks) immediately after each other.

Keep one callout for the highest-priority point; weave the rest into body prose, lists, or table columns.
